msgstr "不要手动刷写这些文件"

msgid "Only the squashfs sysupgrade image is offered as an upgrade candidate. Preloader, BL31/U-Boot, GPT and sdcard images rewrite the boot chain or the partition table; a wrong pick bricks the device instead of failing the upgrade."
msgstr "只有 squashfs 的 sysupgrade 镜像会作为升级候选。preloader、BL31/U-Boot、GPT 与 sdcard 镜像会改写引导链或分区表，选错的后果不是升级失败而是变砖。"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

